          "title": "光纤传导阳光",
          "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201906/bg2019061405.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201906/bg2019061406.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>大楼深处的房间要得到自然光照明，往往非常困难。美国一家创业公司开发了光纤照明系统，在屋顶上架设集光器，收集阳光，然后通过光纤，将阳光导入室内，让地下室也能照到阳光。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/201906/bg2019061407.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "光纤传导阳光",
              "url": "https://www.parans.com/parans-light/how-it-works/"
            }
          ],
